\"Run e2e/local-agent-access.spec.ts, affected settings-categories and visual-regression browser scenarios. Mocked browsers do not prove native file permissions or lock/logout enforcement.\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"frontend-search\\\",\\n      \\\"paths\\\": [\\n        \\\"frontend/src/features/chat/SearchDialog.tsx\\\",\\n        \\\"frontend/src/features/chat/SearchDialog.test.ts\\\",\\n        \\\"frontend/src/features/chat/ConversationView.tsx\\\",\\n        \\\"frontend/src/features/chat/useConversationViewport.ts\\\",\\n        \\\"frontend/src/features/chat/useConversationViewport.test.ts\\\",\\n        \\\"frontend/src/lib/api/chat.ts\\\",\\n        \\\"frontend/src/lib/contactVisibility.ts\\\",\\n        \\\"frontend/src/store/conversationModel.ts\\\",\\n        \\\"frontend/e2e/chat.spec.ts\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"frontend\\\": [\\n        \\\"src/features/chat/SearchDialog.test.ts\\\",\\n        \\\"src/features/chat/ConversationView.test.ts\\\",\\n        \\\"src/features/chat/useConversationViewport.test.ts\\\",\\n        \\\"src/lib/api.test.ts\\\",\\n        \\\"src/lib/contactVisibility.test.ts\\\",\\n        \\\"src/store/conversationHistory.test.ts\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"consumers\\\": [\\n        \\\"frontend-chat\\\",\\n        \\\"frontend-history\\\",\\n        \\\"frontend-local-agent-access\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"capability\\\": {\\n        \\\"summary\\\": \\\"Navigate recent search results by exact owner-scoped namespace and message identity with separate read-only context and explicit coverage.\\\",\\n        \\\"guide\\\": \\\"docs/ARCHITECTURE.md#recent-search-references\\\",\\n        \\\"invariants\\\": [\\n          {\\n            \\\"name\\\": \\\"Duplicate text and timestamps never substitute for an exact selected message ID; unresolved or unavailable references never fall back to approximate matching\\\",\\n            \\\"reference\\\": \\\"docs/ARCHITECTURE.md#recent-search-references\\\"\\n          },\\n          {\\n            \\\"name\\\": \\\"Context presentation cannot replace canonical history, advance unread coverage or cross owner/runtime lifetimes\\\",\\n            \\\"reference\\\": \\\"docs/ARCHITECTURE.md#recent-search-references\\\"\\n          }\\n        ]\\n      },\\n      \\\"escalation\\\": [\\n        \\\"Run search browser scenarios for identical duplicate results, older exact context, unavailable targets, hidden contacts and failed retry. Visible context and delivery changes also require relevant narrow-window and visual-regression scenarios; browser mocks do not certify native IPC authorization.\\\"\\n      ]\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"frontend-delivery-details\\\",\\n      \\\"paths\\\": [\\n        \\\"frontend/e2e/automatic-delivery.spec.ts\\\",\\ndocs/performance-requirements.md:56:| Active business | Bound each query, decrypt, decode, transfer and rendering turn by items and bytes. Drain real available work promptly with backpressure and cancellation; user interaction and reception must remain responsive. Measure latency, peak CPU/memory and I/O for send/receive, catch-up, search, media and navigation as applicable, then prove resources settle when work finishes.                                        |\\ndocs/performance-requirements.md:211:   complete device/account bindings once instead of repeating pairwise searches.\\n\"}","type":"input_text"}],"type":"custom_tool_call_output"},{"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","guardian_metadata":{"client_authored":false,"history_sequence":14306,"model_search_state":"unused","sampled_through_sequence":14305},"id":"rs_0dca4931a04d8132016b03bb79132887d0a978a7b7c0a50721","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a20691-6d63-7020-b3f3-af8984c725f3"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"call_id":"call_c047b5a8fc3f4c8dbe27b82c03f6a3dd","guardian_metadata":{"client_authored":false,"history_sequence":14307,"model_search_state":"unused","sampled_through_sequence