{"timestamp":"2026-11-23T04:17:22.714Z","ordinal":34136,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1feaf-24d9-7612-a284-664abd64a2c4","turn_id":"01a2069c-657a-7d60-9de7-15fae0d142a2","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0dca4931a04d8132016b03be4e709c87d0922b0371a557417b","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Windows 发现任务已接入系统网卡和地址变更通知。回调最多保留一个待处理唤醒，由现有任务重新读取网卡状态。注册失败时保留 2 秒轮询，另保留 30 秒修复周期处理漏掉的通知和组播重加入。[实现](/Users/kingsonwu/programming/OctopusGarage/mesh-talk/crates/mesh-talk-core/src/discovery/interface_events_windows.rs)\n\nWindows 实机通过了注册、两个回调合并、注销和重新注册的测试。测试使用了真实的 Windows 注册接口，并直接调用回调来验证合并行为。真实网卡切换和整机 CPU 收益仍待验证。[测试日志](/Users/kingsonwu/programming/OctopusGarage/mesh-talk/tmp/req-011/windows-interface-probe.Oz62lGlu/windows-test.log)\n\nmacOS 和 Linux 的原生采样已启动。**REQ-011 仍在进行。**"}],"phase":"final_answer"},"content_token_count":213,"started_at_ms":1795407438430,"completed_at_ms":1795407442714}}
