{"timestamp":"2026-11-23T04:49:17.069Z","ordinal":35558,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"task_complete","root_turn_id":"01a206ba-e60c-7892-8e97-034cbfe35fee","turn_id":"01a206ba-e60c-7892-8e97-034cbfe35fee","last_agent_message":"侧栏现在等业务运行时就绪后，才读取网卡信息和 Wi-Fi 名称。这样，macOS 的 `system_profiler` 和其他平台的网络查询工具可以避开打开加密档案的关键路径。原生启动收益仍需复测。[代码](/Users/kingsonwu/programming/OctopusGarage/mesh-talk/frontend/src/features/chat/Sidebar.tsx:149)\n\n回归测试先复现了启动期间提前发起查询的问题。修改后 **30 项单元测试、6 项 Chromium 端到端测试和 ESLint 均通过**。[浏览器测试日志](/Users/kingsonwu/programming/OctopusGarage/mesh-talk/tmp/req-011/sidebar-probe-startup-browser.log)\n\nWindows 空档案仍在采样。**REQ-011 尚未达标。**","started_at":1795409241,"completed_at":1795409357,"duration_ms":115418,"time_to_first_token_ms":4764}}
