{"timestamp":"2026-11-23T05:06:30.192Z","ordinal":36212,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1feaf-24d9-7612-a284-664abd64a2c4","turn_id":"01a206ca-8bd3-7e61-8a39-400f1dbe0d63","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0dca4931a04d8132016b03c9cd7c3887d0bd78a5423e26f461","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"已暂停 **REQ-011** 的性能优化，停止本轮后台构建和验证，保留现有改动与测量证据。性能目标仍未全部达标。\n\n已把后续 AI 迭代需要遵守的规则写入现有文档：\n\n- **邮局节点也要高性能、低功耗。** 启动、空闲、收发与联邦同步、业务结束后回到空闲，都要有可复测的指标。空闲验证要同时覆盖空节点和已有积压的节点。[性能要求](/Users/kingsonwu/programming/OctopusGarage/mesh-talk/docs/performance-requirements.md#headless-post-office-nodes)\n- **优先接入现有事件。** 事件的作用范围、提交时机和生命周期匹配时，直接注册到现有事件或监听器。确实缺少合适信号时，在负责该状态的模块新增事件类型。没有可靠事件时，复用已有的截止时间、退避重试或定时兜底机制。[事件驱动指南](/Users/kingsonwu/programming/OctopusGarage/mesh-talk/docs/event-driven-design.md#register-relay-work-with-its-owner)\n\n已从 [AGENTS.md](/Users/kingsonwu/programming/OctopusGarage/mesh-talk/AGENTS.md) 和 [邮局联邦文档](/Users/kingsonwu/programming/OctopusGarage/mesh-talk/docs/post-office-federation.md) 链接到这些规则。结构检查和差异检查均通过。\n\n**English note**  \n原句「以后再继续优化吧」  \n自然说法 “Let’s pause the optimization here and pick it up later.”  \n`pick it up later` 表示以后接着当前进度做。  \n可复用表达 “Reuse the existing event when it fits.”  \n工程搭配 `event-driven scheduling` · `fallback timer` · `idle resource budget`"}],"phase":"final_answer"},"content_token_count":426,"started_at_ms":1795410381494,"completed_at_ms":1795410390192}}
