{"timestamp":"2026-11-23T05:08:09.364Z","ordinal":36287,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0dca4931a04d8132016b03ca33b96c87d0b4c9bacc6acec393","status":"completed","call_id":"call_2c14663e4eaf4dbfa89eeff80d6c125b","name":"exec","input":"const h=`<style>td,th{text-align:left;padding:4px 12px 4px 0}.bar{height:12px;background:var(--chart-1);border-radius:3px}mark{background:none;color:var(--foreground)}</style><b>参考档案最小化 CPU · 单核占用</b><table><tr><td>预算 0.25%</td><td style=\"width:55vw;max-width:330px\"><div class=\"bar\" style=\"width:25%;background:var(--foreground)\"></div></td></tr><tr><td>Linux 0.49%</td><td><div class=\"bar\" style=\"width:49%\"></div></td></tr><tr><td>Windows 0.62%</td><td><div class=\"bar\" style=\"width:62%\"></div></td></tr><tr><td>macOS 0.93%</td><td><div class=\"bar\" style=\"width:93%\"></div></td></tr></table><small>各平台已完成的候选采样，构建与环境不同。</small>`;store(\"why\",h);text((await tools.mcp__t3_code__html_preview({html:h})).content.filter(x=>x.type===\"text\"))\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a206cd-a4bf-7cc2-bbf1-f49e99f396ab","create_time":1795410483.7292964}},"metadata":{"history_sequence":15386,"sampled_through_sequence":15385,"client_authored":false,"model_search_state":"unused"}}
