{"timestamp":"2026-11-23T05:57:29.010Z","ordinal":37092,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1feaf-24d9-7612-a284-664abd64a2c4","turn_id":"01a206fa-9f20-74d0-b991-c82401f52298","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0dca4931a04d8132016b03d5c0251c87d0b7e8d58d205ed282","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"**建议恢复 REQ-011，但第一轮只解决一个问题：Windows 前台空闲 CPU 超标是否可复现。** 整体目标和现有标准先保留，每轮按一个可验证的结果收口。\n\nWindows 最小化修复已经通过原生行为验收：可选轮询停止、真实消息照常落盘、恢复后轮询重新启动。下一步用**同一二进制、同一机器、同一份 10 万条消息档案**，复测前台空闲。上一次测得 **1.875% 单核 CPU**，超过 **1%** 预算。如果能复现，就分别对宿主、渲染器和 GPU 取样，定位后只改主要瓶颈。如果不能复现，就记录波动条件，再决定是否投入修复。[原生行为证据](/Users/kingsonwu/programming/OctopusGarage/mesh-talk/tmp/req-011/windows-native-minimize.BYtDdUfh/transition-confirm/transitions.json) · [CPU 采样](/Users/kingsonwu/programming/OctopusGarage/mesh-talk/tmp/req-011/windows-native-minimize.BYtDdUfh/focus-retry/current-loaded/desktop-summary.json)\n\n这轮结束后，再分别验收暖启动、桌面内存和邮局节点。**当前 goal 仍是 `paused`**，这次只做了判断。\n\n**English note**  \n「那是不是该恢复 goal，完成 REQ-011？」  \n“Should we resume work on REQ-011 and see it through?”  \n`resume work on` 表示恢复已经开始的工作。  \n`see it through` 强调把事情做到底。  \n可复用表达 “Let’s verify one bottleneck at a time.”"}],"phase":"final_answer"},"content_token_count":390,"started_at_ms":1795413440064,"completed_at_ms":1795413449010}}
{"timestamp":"2026-11-23T05:57:29.026Z","ordinal":37093,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"message","status":"completed","id":"msg_0dca4931a04d8132016b03d5c0251c87d0b7e8d58d205ed282","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"output_text","text":"**建议恢复 REQ-011，但第一轮只解决一个问题：Windows 前台空闲 CPU 超标是否可复现。** 整体目标和现有标准先保留，每轮按一个可验证的结果收口。\n\nWindows 最小化修复已经通过原生行为验收：可选轮询停止、真实消息照常落盘、恢复后轮询重新启动。下一步用**同一二进制、同一机器、同一份 10 万条消息档案**，复测前台空闲。上一次测得 **1.875% 单核 CPU**，超过 **1%** 预算。如果能复现，就分别对宿主、渲染器和 GPU 取样，定位后只改主要瓶颈。如果不能复现，就记录波动条件，再决定是否投入修复。[原生行为证据](/Users/kingsonwu/programming/OctopusGarage/mesh-talk/tmp/req-011/windows-native-minimize.BYtDdUfh/transition-confirm/transitions.json) · [CPU 采样](/Users/kingsonwu/programming/OctopusGarage/mesh-talk/tmp/req-011/windows-native-minimize.BYtDdUfh/focus-retry/current-loaded/desktop-summary.json)\n\n这轮结束后，再分别验收暖启动、桌面内存和邮局节点。**当前 goal 仍是 `paused`**，这次只做了判断。\n\n**English note**  \n「那是不是该恢复 goal，完成 REQ-011？」  \n“Should we resume work on REQ-011 and see it through?”  \n`resume work on` 表示恢复已经开始的工作。  \n`see it through` 强调把事情做到底。  \n可复用表达 “Let’s verify one bottleneck at a time.”","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a206fa-9f20-74d0-b991-c82401f52298","create_time":1795413440.1519885,"content_item_kinds":["unknown"]}},"metadata":{"history_sequence":15742,"sampled_through_sequence":15741,"retained_source":{"id":{"message_id":"msg_0dca4931a04d8132016b03d5c0251c87d0b7e8d58d205ed282","turn_id":"01a206fa-9f20-74d0-b991-c82401f52298","role":"assistant"},"revision":"retained_01a206fb-1942-7f32-8392-0fd2762c42f7","complete":true},"client_authored":false,"user_input_order":1738,"model_search_state":"unused"}}
