{"timestamp":"2026-11-23T06:14:24.157Z","ordinal":37479,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1feaf-24d9-7612-a284-664abd64a2c4","turn_id":"01a20706-0b66-75d1-a839-57280589689c","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0dca4931a04d8132016b03d9b9c74487d091bc76373a3a5ad4","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"定位到此前 Windows 空闲复测的一个夹具问题：测试复制了原生档案，却复用了 WebView2 的持久存储。页面因此反复拿上一轮保存的游标请求接收页。为同一二进制配置独立 WebView2 目录后，短诊断里的接收请求成功返回，未再出现 `stale event page cursor`。[隔离后的诊断](/Users/kingsonwu/programming/OctopusGarage/mesh-talk/tmp/req-011/windows-native-minimize.BYtDdUfh/reception-isolated-retry.JL0kscJP/renderer-trace.json) · [WebView2 配置说明](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/webview2/reference/win32/webview2-idl?view=webview2-1.0.4258.31)\n\n此前两次前台超标样本仍有诊断价值，但含有故障重试，不能用来判断健康档案的空闲成本。已启动完整复测，并把原生档案和渲染器存储必须一起隔离的规则写入性能规范。**REQ-011 继续进行。** [性能规范](/Users/kingsonwu/programming/OctopusGarage/mesh-talk/docs/performance-requirements.md:382)"}],"phase":"final_answer"},"content_token_count":289,"started_at_ms":1795414457755,"completed_at_ms":1795414464157}}
