{"timestamp":"2026-11-23T06:20:46.657Z","ordinal":37572,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1feaf-24d9-7612-a284-664abd64a2c4","turn_id":"01a2070a-9e7c-75e1-8825-46f74d75b0bf","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0dca4931a04d8132016b03db398ad487d0ba5ae70ce9c5984b","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"**Windows 前台空闲 CPU 通过本轮验收。** 同一二进制、同一台机器、同一份 10 万条消息档案，在隔离 WebView2 存储后完成了 327 秒采样。106 个样本均核验了原生前台窗口。此前的超标样本包含旧游标故障重试，应保留为故障诊断证据。[前台复测报告](/Users/kingsonwu/programming/OctopusGarage/mesh-talk/tmp/req-011/windows-native-minimize.BYtDdUfh/foreground-isolated.Kl6j740V/desktop-summary.json)\n\n接收重试新增了两项边界验证：连续失败时最长每 60 秒自动重试一次，会话退出后取消待执行重试。接收相关测试 **12 项通过**。[测试日志](/Users/kingsonwu/programming/OctopusGarage/mesh-talk/tmp/req-011/reception-retry-cap-tests.log)\n\n已启动同样隔离条件下的最小化复测。**REQ-011 整体仍在进行。**"}],"phase":"final_answer"},"content_token_count":247,"started_at_ms":1795414841625,"completed_at_ms":1795414846657}}
