息档案，在隔离 WebView2 存储后完成了 327 秒采样。106 个样本均核验了原生前台窗口。此前的超标样本包含旧游标故障重试，应保留为故障诊断证据。[前台复测报告](/Users/kingsonwu/programming/OctopusGarage/mesh-talk/tmp/req-011/windows-native-minimize.BYtDdUfh/foreground-isolated.Kl6j740V/desktop-summary.json)\n\n接收重试新增了两项边界验证：连续失败时最长每 60 秒自动重试一次，会话退出后取消待执行重试。接收相关测试 **12 项通过**。[测试日志](/Users/kingsonwu/programming/OctopusGarage/mesh-talk/tmp/req-011/reception-retry-cap-tests.log)\n\n已启动同样隔离条件下的最小化复测。**REQ-011 整体仍在进行。**","type":"output_text"}],"guardian_metadata":{"client_authored":false,"history_sequence":15945,"model_search_state":"unused","sampled_through_sequence":15944,"user_input_order":1764},"id":"msg_0dca4931a04d8132016b03db398ad487d0ba5ae70ce9c5984b","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["unknown"],"create_time":1795414841.691716,"turn_id":"01a2070a-9e7c-75e1-8825-46f74d75b0bf"},"phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant","status":"completed","type":"message"},{"guardian_metadata":{"additional_context_tool_output":true,"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000,"history_sequence":15946,"model_search_state":"unused","sampled_through_sequence":15944},"id":"fco_01a20710-7201-7372-88b7-1712288b4a21","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1795414848.017211,"turn_id":"01a20710-71fc-7bb1-bf2a-da2f8958e299"},"name":"goal_objective","namespace":"agent","output":"continue to optimize util reaching the performance standards","type":"function_call_output"},{"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","guardian_metadata":{"client_authored":false,"history_sequence":15948,"model_search_state":"unused","sampled_through_sequence":15947},"id":"rs_0dca4931a04d8132016b03db45ffa887d083cf7509150263d6","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a20710-71fc-7bb1-bf2a-da2f8958e299"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"content":[{"annotations":[],"logprobs":[],"text":"Windows 最小化复测期间，我会推进 macOS 暖启动的独立对照，验证并行打开日志能否降低启动耗时。","type":"output_text"}],"guardian_metadata":{"client_authored":false,"h