{"timestamp":"2026-11-23T06:25:11.279Z","ordinal":37749,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"task_complete","root_turn_id":"01a20713-260c-7220-85d2-03a3f667543a","turn_id":"01a20713-260c-7220-85d2-03a3f667543a","last_agent_message":"REQ-011 仍在进行。macOS 的诊断采样显示，最小化后的大部分时间，整组进程约用 **0.51% 单逻辑核**。第 280–320 秒窗口升到 **4.14%**，同时捕获到群组访问查询读取 SQLite 的调用栈。五分钟 roster 兜底是待确认的触发源。即使消除这次尖峰，平时的开销仍高于 **0.25%** 的目标。 [分段采样](/Users/kingsonwu/programming/OctopusGarage/mesh-talk/tmp/req-011/native-proof-gated.KeJDPGsv/residual-cpu-attribution/residual-window-attribution.json)\n\nWindows 原生最小化复测和 macOS 暖启动对照构建均已确认仍在运行。本轮没有调整恢复周期。","started_at":1795415025,"completed_at":1795415111,"duration_ms":86106,"time_to_first_token_ms":2977}}
