on payloads while retaining active navigation and exact deletion/intent authority.\\\",\\n874:            \\\"name\\\": \\\"The thirty-second identity boot window includes native read waits; failure retains bounded background recovery without crossing owner/run lifetimes\\\",\\n1163:        \\\"summary\\\": \\\"Age source-specific presence presentation independently of fresh device evidence.\\\",\\n1244:        \\\"frontend/src/lib/recoveryRefresh.test.ts\\\",\\n1267:        \\\"src/lib/recoveryRefresh.test.ts\\\",\\n1304:            \\\"name\\\": \\\"Contact and privacy policy reads release presentation loading after a bounded wait, preserve explicit error recovery and reject late snapshots from expired reads or retired sessions without timing out mutation ownership.\\\",\\n1308:            \\\"name\\\": \\\"Semantic invalidations and coalesced activation remain prompt; modern quiet projections use sparse recovery, presentation-only hidden owners park timers, and legacy reads preserve bounded progress.\\\",\\n1519:            \\\"name\\\": \\\"Channel mention browser assertions await the current virtual message list's actual presentation under the existing whole-test watchdog; retained real animation frames cannot produce premature readiness, and message visibility and mention-clear assertions remain intact\\\",\\n1773:            \\\"name\\\": \\\"Repeated date/time presentation reuses at most 256 display strings under current locale and fresh local calendar fields; live timezone, DST and today/yesterday classification remain native-equivalent without retaining message identities or starting timers.\\\",\\n1888:            \\\"name\\\": \\\"A canonical bounded filename carries presentation identity; the authenticated manifest binds image bytes. Existing pending metadata owns serial installed-source preparation: no demand reads no artwork, filtered pages retain progress and cache eviction permits re-demand. Current owner/account and content fences remain authoritative.\\\",\\n1905:            \\\"reference\\\": \\\"docs/module-boundaries.md#inline-media-presentation\\\"\\n2132:        \\\"Run e2e/screenshot-shortcuts.spec.ts and relevant screenshot browser scenarios; verify actual OS key delivery, occupied shortcuts, tray/background wakeup, lock/logout and window restoration in packaged apps. Linux global activation requires native X11. Browser events do not certify native behavior.\\\"\\n2327:        \\\"frontend/e2e/media-message-presentation.spec.ts\\\"\\n2342:        \\\"guide\\\": \\\"docs/module-boundaries.md#inline-media-presentation\\\",\\n2346:            \\\"reference\\\": \\\"docs/module-boundaries.md#inline-media-presentation\\\"\\n__pycache__\\nbuild.log\\nmeasure.py\\n   Compiling clap v4.6.7\\n   Compiling x25519-dalek v3.0.0\\n   Compiling uuid v1.29.2\\n   Compiling if-addrs v0.15.0\\n   Compiling log v0.4.35\\n   Compiling mesh-talk-core v0.4.6 (/Users/kingsonwu/programming/OctopusGarage/mesh-talk/crates/mesh-talk-core)\\n1795415857\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a2071e-f3c3-7b83-bdd5-c4d356432648","create_time":1795415857.479209}},"metadata":{"history_sequence":16271,"sampled_through_sequence":16268,"client_authored":false,"fallback_token_limit_override":12000,"model_search_state":"unused"}}
