{"timestamp":"2026-11-23T06:53:59.890Z","ordinal":39012,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"task_complete","root_turn_id":"01a2072d-189a-7772-9fa4-732d4711088d","turn_id":"01a2072d-189a-7772-9fa4-732d4711088d","last_agent_message":"Post Office 已生成并重启校验 **100 个邮箱、10 万条加密信封**，保留约 **76 MiB**。Linux 容器已用该档案启动真实 `--post-office` 进程，正在采集满载档案的空闲指标。 [负载校验结果](/Users/kingsonwu/programming/OctopusGarage/mesh-talk/tmp/req-011/linux-relay-loaded.SDiwgSbc/fixture.json)\n\n接收唤醒的回归用例仍在编译。实现草案已准备好，现有变更仍需验证接收游标能及时推进，以及混合状态变化和会话替换时的行为。REQ-011 继续进行。","started_at":1795416725,"completed_at":1795416839,"duration_ms":114210,"time_to_first_token_ms":4210}}
