{"timestamp":"2026-11-23T06:54:18.997Z","ordinal":39031,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1feaf-24d9-7612-a284-664abd64a2c4","turn_id":"01a2072e-d6d3-78f3-ba0b-c66aca2bb334","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-0466d7f0-d031-43ad-a6d1-cfd4fc54a2aa","process_id":"14706","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","python3 tmp/req-011/apply-scoped-reception-wake.py\nrg -n 'fn authority\\(' src-tauri/src/runtime_bootstrap.rs\nsed -n '1343,1380p' src-tauri/src/runtime_bootstrap.rs\nsed -n '384,425p' src-tauri/validation.json\nrg -n 'Durable reception|reception wake' docs/event-driven-design.md | head -12\ngit diff --check"],"cwd":"file:///Users/kingsonwu/programming/OctopusGarage/mesh-talk","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"python3 tmp/req-011/apply-scoped-reception-wake.py\nrg -n 'fn authority\\(' src-tauri/src/runtime_bootstrap.rs\nsed -n '1343,1380p' src-tauri/src/runtime_bootstrap.rs\nsed -n '384,425p' src-tauri/validation.json\nrg -n 'Durable reception|reception wake' docs/event-driven-design.md | head -12\ngit diff --check"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"692:    fn authority() -> (\n            |_| {},\n        )\n        .await\n        .unwrap();\n        assert_eq!(joined.handle().linked_devices().len(), 2);\n        bind_account_profile(root.path(), \"owner\", &joined, \"Joining local nickname\").unwrap();\n        assert_eq!(\n            joined\n                .handle()\n                .account_profile(&account_id)\n                .unwrap()\n                .unwrap()\n                .display_name,\n            \"Kept account\"\n        );\n        assert_eq!(joined.display_name(), \"Kept account\");\n        joined.stop().await;\n    }\n\n    #[tokio::test]\n    async fn host_producers_wait_for_successful_installation() {\n        let (installed, ready) = tokio::sync::watch::channel(false);\n        let (produced, mut receiver) = tokio::sync::mpsc::channel(1);\n        let task = tokio::spawn(after_install(ready, async move {\n            produced.send(()).await.unwrap();\n        }));\n        tokio::task::yield_now().await;\n        assert!(receiver.try_recv().is_err());\n        installed.send_replace(true);\n        task.await.unwrap();\n        assert!(receiver.try_recv().is_ok());\n        let (installation, ready) = tokio::sync::watch::channel(false);\n        drop(installation);\n        after_install(ready, async {\n            panic!(\"failed installation must not run host producers\")\n        })\n        .await;\n    }\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"consumers\": [\"frontend-shared-channel-custody\"],\n      \"escalation\": [\n        \"Verify registered IPC and actual linked-device group footer convergence.\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"desktop-startup-identity\",\n      \"paths\": [\n        \"src-tauri/src/chat_commands/state.rs\",\n        \"src-tauri/src/runtime_bootstrap.rs\",\n        \"src-tauri/src/owner_commands.rs\"\n      ],\n      \"rust\": [\n        {\n          \"package\": \"mesh-talk\",\n          \"filters\": [\n            \"registered_startup_identity_is_ids_only_and_denies_locked_or_replaced_sessions\",\n            \"startup_identity_cancelled_while_waiting_for_serialization_clears_pending\",\n            \"startup_identity_failure_and_cancellation_clear_only_current_observation\",\n            \"startup_identity_installation_keeps_ready_until_next_ticket\",\n            \"startup_identity_is_observable_before_runtime_installation_and_failure_retires_it\",\n            \"startup_identity_rejects_same_owner_replacement_and_signed_out_observers\"\n          ]\n        }\n      ],\n      \"capability\": {\n        \"summary\": \"Expose IDs-only startup appearance observation under exact desktop session, startup ticket and app-lock authority.\",\n        \"guide\": \"docs/CUSTOMIZATION_PACKS.md#account-scoped-startup-appearance\",\n        \"invariants\": [\n          {\n            \"name\": \"Pending, failed, canceled and replaced startups cannot disclose retired identity; observing early identity does not admit runtime commands.\",\n            \"reference\": \"docs/ARCHITECTURE.md\"\n          }\n        ]\n      },\n      \"consumers\": [\"frontend-startup-appearance\"],\n      \"escalation\": [\n        \"Verify native cold startup and same-owner replacement; browser mocks alone cannot prove keystore identity or cancellation ownership.\"\n      ]\n29:| Runtime startup readiness | The Host installs an authenticated runtime and sends the existing scoped reception wake. | The [renderer boot owner](../frontend/src/store/chat.ts) coalesces the wake for its active startup request and re-reads native identity. An earlier hint can accelerate the read. The repair timer covers missing hints, and current desktop identity still gates readiness. |\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":30538333}},"started_at_ms":1795416858967,"completed_at_ms":1795416858997}}
