{"timestamp":"2026-11-23T07:03:32.208Z","ordinal":39364,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1feaf-24d9-7612-a284-664abd64a2c4","turn_id":"01a20737-1427-79c2-bcc8-ba7ba5c2eb8f","item":{"type":"CommandExecution","id":"exec-602407fe-f85a-4898-8b1d-71fdce5efb01","process_id":"97941","command":["/bin/zsh","-lc","rg -n 'issue|enroll|federat|network-policy' crates/mesh-talk-core/src/bin/mesh-talk-node.rs | head -34\nrg -n 'network-policy|network-membership|mesh-talk-node.*network|enrollment' docs/post-office-federation.md | head -25\nrg --files crates/mesh-talk-core/src/bin | rg 'relay|network' | head -22\ntail -8 tmp/req-011/hidden-group-repair-typecheck.log"],"cwd":"file:///Users/kingsonwu/programming/OctopusGarage/mesh-talk","parsed_cmd":[{"type":"unknown","cmd":"rg -n 'issue|enroll|federat|network-policy' crates/mesh-talk-core/src/bin/mesh-talk-node.rs | head -34\nrg -n 'network-policy|network-membership|mesh-talk-node.*network|enrollment' docs/post-office-federation.md | head -25\nrg --files crates/mesh-talk-core/src/bin | rg 'relay|network' | head -22\ntail -8 tmp/req-011/hidden-group-repair-typecheck.log"}],"source":"unified_exec_startup","status":"completed","aggregated_output":"20:use mesh_talk_core::postoffice::federation::{\n31:#[path = \"mesh-talk-node/federation_config.rs\"]\n32:mod federation_config;\n33:#[path = \"mesh-talk-node/federation_runtime.rs\"]\n34:mod federation_runtime;\n43:use federation_config::{FederationSeed, parse_fingerprint};\n44:use federation_runtime::run_federation_loop;\n107:    /// Equal federation relay seed: <full-fingerprint>@<routed-ip>:<discovery-udp-port>.\n109:    #[arg(long = \"federation-peer\", requires_all = [\"post_office\", \"bridge\"])]\n110:    federation_peers: Vec<FederationSeed>,\n112:    #[arg(long, requires_all = [\"post_office\", \"bridge\"], conflicts_with = \"federation_peers\")]\n113:    federation_config: Option<std::path::PathBuf>,\n115:    #[arg(long, requires_all = [\"post_office\", \"relay_membership\"], conflicts_with_all = [\"federation_config\", \"federation_peers\", \"bridge_peer\"])]\n278:    if std::env::args_os().nth(1).as_deref() == Some(std::ffi::OsStr::new(\"federation\")) {\n279:        return federation_config::run_cli();\n286:    if let Some(path) = args.federation_config.as_deref() {\n287:        args.federation_peers = federation_config::load(path)?;\n699:    let federation_enabled =\n700:        network.is_some() || args.federation_config.is_some() || !args.federation_peers.is_empty();\n701:    let directory = if federation_enabled || gateway.is_some() || args.bridge {\n712:        federation_enabled.then(|| {\n714:                args.federation_peers\n727:        args.federation_peers\n730:        if let Some(directory) = directory.filter(|_| federation_enabled) {\n731:            run_federation_loop(\n749:    if federation_enabled {\n750:        emit(\"post-office federation ready; software integrity not attested\");\n1086:    fn federation_seed_requires_full_identity_and_routed_endpoint() {\n1112:            \"--federation-peer\",\n1114:            \"--federation-peer\",\n1118:        assert_eq!(args.federation_peers.len(), 2);\n36:Create the network on an enrollment workstation, keeping the private authority\n40:mesh-talk-node network init --authority-key authority.key --policy network.policy\n48:mesh-talk-node network enroll --authority-key authority.key --policy network.policy \\\n50:mesh-talk-node network inspect --policy network.policy --membership alice-relay.membership\n89:mesh-talk-node network revoke --policy network.policy --device aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa\n116:cover public-file persistence without the enrollment key. These are not evidence\n138:through a trusted channel before enrollment. Multiple endpoints may name the\n193:concurrent enrollment/revocation cannot lose updates or restore revoked pins.\ncrates/mesh-talk-core/src/bin/mesh-talk-node/relay_runtime.rs\ncrates/mesh-talk-core/src/bin/mesh-talk-node/network_config.rs\n\n> typecheck\n> tsc --noEmit && tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.e2e.json\n\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":23167}},"started_at_ms":1795417412208,"completed_at_ms":1795417412208}}
