{"timestamp":"2026-11-23T07:19:22.851Z","ordinal":39892,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a1feaf-24d9-7612-a284-664abd64a2c4","turn_id":"01a20744-ecdc-7a41-bab7-c66a90d52b23","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0dca4931a04d8132016b03e8f8528c87d0b4b857a46f91702d","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"Linux 原生复测已排在 release 构建之后。它会用同一二进制和独立档案，分别测量 **10 万条消息**档案与空档案的前台和最小化阶段，并记录进程组 CPU、PSS、私有驻留内存和写入。测试入口会校验窗口状态和档案规模，结果待运行。\n\nmacOS 前台采样、Windows 构建和 Post Office 整小时采样仍在运行。REQ-011 尚未完成。"}],"phase":"final_answer"},"content_token_count":118,"started_at_ms":1795418360317,"completed_at_ms":1795418362851}}
