n.\\n- **Captured / updated:** 2026-11-17 (Asia/Singapore).\\n- **Original user input:** “第23个需求：局域网语音实时会议，（以及视频会议后续）这个可能以来群组去中心协议消息同步协议底层先做好，这样才能更好的实现这个功能”。\\n- **Scenario and affected users:** People on a LAN participating in a live multiparty voice meeting; video meetings are a later possible expansion.\\n- **Pain point or question:** Define how real-time meetings fit the decentralized group and communication model. Existing call/multiparty capabilities and gaps have not been inspected; do not assume no calling support exists.\\n- **Desired outcome:** A reliable LAN voice-meeting experience reusing suitable existing foundations, with explicit performance, permissions and lifecycle behavior; video kept as a later direction.\\n- **Confirmed scope from user:** Real-time LAN voice meetings now as a requirement topic; video later. User suspects group/decentralized messaging/sync foundations should be improved first; this is a proposed dependency to verify, not a settled development sequence or permission to implement.\\n- **Additional confirmed scenario and boundaries:** Start voice meetings from an existing Mesh Talk group; group members actively choose to join. Independent temporary rooms and video remain later directions. Underlying protocol dependencies still require verification. Continue clarification without investigation or implementation.\\n- **Additional original user clarification:** “REQ-023 先以现有 Mesh Talk 群聊发起语音会议、群成员主动加入为主要场景；独立临时会议房间和视频保留为后续方向，底层协议依赖仍待验证。请更新文档，继续澄清关键边界，暂不调查或实施。”\\n- **Assistant-proposed detailed clarification boundaries — unconfirmed:**\\n  - Distinguish meeting admission/invitations, participant/role state and call signaling from real-time audio transport. Reuse identity, permissions and suitable signaling mechanisms without assuming audio should be persisted/replayed as ordinary message history.\\n\"}"}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a20756-9c6d-7151-b9aa-d3f86228c963","create_time":1795419692.756552}},"me